            <iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?width=600&height=400&hl=en&q=Facultatea%20de%20Matematica%20si%20Informatic%C4%83%20Bucuresti&t=&z=14&ie=UTF8&iwloc=B&output=embed" width="600" height="400" frameborder="0" scrolling="no" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0"></iframe>
